WEBVTT

00:09:28.954 --> 00:09:33.496
seeking feedback by asking what your
limitations are and how you can improve,

00:09:33.746 --> 00:09:37.037
you don't just get to peek inside the
black box of how to get that job,

00:09:37.037 --> 00:09:39.412
that connection or that coveted project.

00:09:40.037 --> 00:09:42.204
You also get in a sense
of control to address

00:09:42.204 --> 00:09:44.996
the issues that may be preventing
you from getting an opportunity.

00:09:45.621 --> 00:09:48.412
But people won't always tell
you what you can do better.

00:09:48.871 --> 00:09:52.246
And sometimes you can't even get your
foot in the door to ask them,

00:09:52.704 --> 00:09:54.621
you know, all those YouTube
videos that you watch

00:09:54.621 --> 00:09:57.912
and all those things that interrupt you
and jam their way into your face.

00:09:57.954 --> 00:09:58.954
I do those.

00:09:59.037 --> 00:10:01.912
Dallas McGlaughlin started building
websites as a teenager